{
  // Nearly empty on purpose, and here so the directory can be a workspace
  // member at all — everything this package needs is said once at the
  // workspace root, ts/deno.jsonc.
  //
  // What the package is called is `@xpute/host/`, and it is called that by
  // the import maps: ts/deno.jsonc's, and a program's that links this
  // tree, both map that prefix onto this `src/`, and every import
  // resolves through it. Saying the name here as well would be a
  // second place for it without a first consumer — nothing imports the bare
  // name, and Deno asks a named package what it exports, which is a list of every
  // module under src/ and so a copy of the tree to keep in step.
  //
  // Both belong here the day this is published, and will then say what is
  // published rather than restate what already resolves.
}
